{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123021","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123021","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1012302101:0":{"text":"モルフォチョウはミサタ様の使者であり、自由と安寧の象徴なんです！","source_cn":"蓝色闪蝶是弥萨忒的信使，蓝色闪蝶出现，代表宁静，和自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x148FA0DB2462B793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012302102:0":{"text":"ですが、黒い蝶々はどこから来たんでしょう……ユグドラシルでは一度も見たことがありません。","source_cn":"但黑色蝴蝶是哪里来的……我从来没在薄暮丛林见过它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5511C73E23E1D6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012302103:0":{"text":"私も見たことがない。森の外にいた頃も、たまに蝶々を目にしたことはあるが……","source_cn":"我也从未见过，在外游学时，我偶尔也能见到一些蝴蝶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B874C9BD46EA27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012302104:0":{"text":"この蝶は何かが違う……不吉な予兆でなければいいのだが……","source_cn":"但这些……不一样。希望它们的出现不是不祥之兆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A959B7AC0D2C93F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}